</figure>

A second generation went better. I asked for a flat `#00FF00` background instead of transparency, which gives the cleanup something unambiguous to key out. proper-pixel-art turned that into a 32×33 grid with the green removed and three colours left. It is a usable sprite, but it is still the model's size, not mine: the box is 20×20 rather than 16×16.

